# Files a test run drops in the REPO ROOT. The testcases `$fopen` these with a
# relative path, so they land in whatever directory `cargo test` ran from —
# they are outputs, not fixtures. PR #99 committed several of them by accident.
#   fscanf_pos_tmp.txt  tests/classes/nonvirtual_dispatch_fscanf_process.rs
#   ch21_memdump.dec    $readmemh/$writememh round-trip case
#   /work/              ivtest-derived cases writing work/{temp,test,...}
# `/work/` is deliberately root-anchored: `simtest/xuantie_c906/work/c906.fl`
# is a tracked fixture and an unanchored `work/` would swallow it.
fscanf_pos_tmp.txt
ch21_memdump.dec
/work/
